{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《美食強人》火花四濺，在明晚（26日）播出的海南雞飯主題中，評審之間再爆激烈爭論！星級食評家肥媽竟因一碗南瓜湯，當場質疑麗晶酒店行政總廚蔡俊輝的味覺，場面一度緊張。同時，米芝蓮三星名廚歐國強更為廚師發聲，驚爆「虐待廚師」論，令全場</p>\n<p>\nTVB節目《美食強人》火花四濺，在最新一集播出的海南雞飯主題中，評審之間再爆激烈爭論！星級食評家肥媽竟因一碗南瓜湯，當場質疑麗晶酒店行政總廚蔡俊輝的味覺，場面一度緊張。同時，米芝蓮三星名廚歐國強更為廚師發聲，驚爆「虐待廚師」論，令全場嘩然！\n</p>\n<h2>肥媽為南瓜湯動怒 質疑麗晶總廚：懷疑我人生？</h2>\n<p>本輪評審過程氣氛熾熱，當麗晶酒店行政總廚蔡俊輝指飲不出其中一家店的湯採用了南瓜食材時，向來敢言的肥媽即時按捺不住，激動地反問：「南瓜湯你都飲唔出係南瓜，師傅你真係有啲咁多懷疑我嘅人生？」面對肥媽的強烈質疑，蔡俊輝則幽默地冷靜回應：「我唔係反駁，我講緊我嘅感覺啫。」幸得主持周奕瑋發揮本色打圓場，才化解緊張氣氛。</p>\n<h2>歐國強為廚師發聲 怒轟機器取代人手</h2>\n<p>除了評審間的直接衝突，節目亦就「機器定人手準備食材」進行激辯。對此，全球最年輕米芝蓮三星中菜名廚歐國強師傅，便以行內人身份為廚師發聲，他認為處理少量食材是興趣，但大量重複的工作則是折磨，更爆出金句：「一日浸十隻、八隻嗰啲叫興趣，講真，一日浸百隻雞唔好話興趣，你簡直係虐待個廚師架啫。」言論一針見血，道出不少廚師心聲。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚節目夠真：嘈交先有火花</h2>\n<p>節目中評審們的激烈互動，引來網民一面倒讚好，認為夠真實、有火花，不像其他美食節目般只有讚美。不少網民力撐肥媽敢言，亦有人欣賞酒店總廚的高EQ回應，而歐國強師傅的「虐待論」更獲得廣泛共鳴。<br/>\n「肥媽好真！夠薑喺總廚面前咁講！」<br/>\n「歐國強師傅講出重點，飲食業真係好辛苦。」<br/>\n「個總廚EQ好高，答得好得體。」<br/>\n「其實係咪節目效果咋？不過嘈交先有收視，好睇！」<br>\n「周奕瑋真係最佳主持，次次都係佢打圓場。」</br></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_3338070106add7ef6e5501.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_3338070106add7ef6e5501.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_764473166add7f17daeb3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_764473166add7f17daeb3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_20524277946add7f1b693b6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_20524277946add7f1b693b6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_20029621716add7f1eb6485.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/14_20029621716add7f1eb6485.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_20002365936add7f21eb8e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/15_20002365936add7f21eb8e9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_12339896916add7f25ae323.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_12339896916add7f25ae323.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_20151102566add7f29051f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17_20151102566add7f29051f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_15998654526add7f2c5ec88.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_15998654526add7f2c5ec88.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_8084788736add7f3707827.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_8084788736add7f3707827.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/-tvbusa-2-42-screenshot_19351896536add93cc72811-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/-tvbusa-2-42-screenshot_19351896536add93cc72811-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:07.940798+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1135,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:32.472068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:28.111555+00:00","content_hash":"764fcc781b91b1b86552a38c0ae0c1295fc1a3fc3c98a3bb29651e3b7719d333","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}